import{_ as i,o as t,c as n,a2 as a}from"./chunks/framework.CqpfiAoK.js";const d=JSON.parse('{"title":"Entry 400 | Manghuang System Decomposition · Qi-Refining-System Critique: The Zero-Sum Game of Devouring Heaven-Earth Qi","description":"","frontmatter":{"title":"Entry 400 | Manghuang System Decomposition · Qi-Refining-System Critique: The Zero-Sum Game of Devouring Heaven-Earth Qi","no":400,"module":2,"tags":["Manghuang Ji","Ji Ning","Qi-Refining System","Heaven-Earth Qi","Zero-Sum Game"],"related":["15-Energy Circulation and Transformation Law","18-Cultivation-Resource Opening Mechanism","04-Anti-Predation Core Thesis"]},"headers":[],"relativePath":"en/0400_模块2-莽荒纪-炼气体系批判-掠夺天地灵气的零和博弈.md","filePath":"en/0400_模块2-莽荒纪-炼气体系批判-掠夺天地灵气的零和博弈.md"}'),o={name:"en/0400_模块2-莽荒纪-炼气体系批判-掠夺天地灵气的零和博弈.md"};function s(r,e,l,h,u,c){return t(),n("div",null,[...e[0]||(e[0]=[a('<h1 id="entry-400-manghuang-system-decomposition-·-qi-refining-system-critique-the-zero-sum-game-of-devouring-heaven-earth-qi" tabindex="-1">Entry 400 | Manghuang System Decomposition · Qi-Refining-System Critique: The Zero-Sum Game of Devouring Heaven-Earth Qi <a class="header-anchor" href="#entry-400-manghuang-system-decomposition-·-qi-refining-system-critique-the-zero-sum-game-of-devouring-heaven-earth-qi" aria-label="Permalink to &quot;Entry 400 | Manghuang System Decomposition · Qi-Refining-System Critique: The Zero-Sum Game of Devouring Heaven-Earth Qi&quot;">​</a></h1><blockquote><p>Module: Module 2 · Myriad-Realms Benchmark Critique Library | Series: Manghuang Ji Full Decomposition (Entry 5) | Benchmark base: Documents 15, 18, 04</p></blockquote><h2 id="introduction-cultivation-s-first-principle-is-treating-heaven-and-earth-as-an-atm" tabindex="-1">Introduction: cultivation&#39;s first principle is treating heaven and earth as an ATM <a class="header-anchor" href="#introduction-cultivation-s-first-principle-is-treating-heaven-and-earth-as-an-atm" aria-label="Permalink to &quot;Introduction: cultivation&#39;s first principle is treating heaven and earth as an ATM&quot;">​</a></h2><p>Among the six top-level axioms, the anti-predation axiom requires developing increment and not consuming stock; the republican axiom of Myriad Races requires all beings equal evolution. This entry specializes in decomposing Manghuang&#39;s <strong>qi-refining system</strong> — this system is almost the textbook definition of &quot;predating stock&quot;: cultivators breathe in heaven-earth qi; qi is finite stock; you take one more breath, others take one less. The law-first axiom reminds us: to judge a cultivation system&#39;s good or evil, look at whether its energy loop is &quot;blood-drawing&quot; or &quot;symbiotic.&quot; Protagonist uniqueness dependency = high-leaning-medium. The universal equal infinite law: within the Anchor Symbiotic Civilization, all beings inherently possess basic infinite power; the easygoing retain a guaranteed basic infinity and will never be eliminated; strivers and Youth Supremes can superimpose more and higher levels of infinity. Infinite origin is inherent in all, so predation naturally loses its meaning. Heng Yuan Zhou&#39;s judging base has been upgraded to the six top-level axioms.</p><h2 id="i-energy-level-waste-analysis-of-this-system-s-strong-ones" tabindex="-1">I. &quot;Energy-Level Waste&quot; Analysis of This System&#39;s Strong Ones <a class="header-anchor" href="#i-energy-level-waste-analysis-of-this-system-s-strong-ones" aria-label="Permalink to &quot;I. &quot;Energy-Level Waste&quot; Analysis of This System&#39;s Strong Ones&quot;">​</a></h2><p>The qi-refining system&#39;s energy waste is systemic: after qi is drawn into a cultivator&#39;s dantian, most dissipates as heat in &quot;breakthrough–battle–lifespan burning&quot;; very little sediments into inheritable law knowledge. Top cultivators like Ji Ning are even qi black holes — wherever he goes, the local spirit vein thins a few degrees. <strong>High absorption, low sedimentation, high dissipation</strong> is precisely the energy-waste triangle.</p><h2 id="ii-why-this-civilization-inevits-historical-regression" tabindex="-1">II. Why This Civilization Inevits Historical Regression <a class="header-anchor" href="#ii-why-this-civilization-inevits-historical-regression" aria-label="Permalink to &quot;II. Why This Civilization Inevits Historical Regression&quot;">​</a></h2><p>The qi-refining zero-sum game&#39;s regression logic:</p><ol><li><strong>Spirit veins finite</strong>: a domain&#39;s total qi is constant; the more and stronger cultivators, the less each person can draw, so &quot;spirit-vein fighting&quot; never stops</li><li><strong>Blessed lands monopolized</strong>: qi-rich places are circled by great sects, great clans; those without backing can only hard-cultivate in thin lands — this is cultivation-version &quot;land enclosure&quot;</li><li><strong>Generation deterioration</strong>: generations of cultivators extract make spirit veins non-renewable; later generations face an increasingly impoverished heaven and earth</li></ol><h2 id="iii-deep-decomposition-of-the-protagonist-s-predatory-thinking" tabindex="-1">III. Deep Decomposition of the Protagonist&#39;s Predatory Thinking <a class="header-anchor" href="#iii-deep-decomposition-of-the-protagonist-s-predatory-thinking" aria-label="Permalink to &quot;III. Deep Decomposition of the Protagonist&#39;s Predatory Thinking&quot;">​</a></h2><p>The predatory core of Ji Ning&#39;s qi-refining road:</p><ul><li><strong>Breathing in is predation</strong>: qi-refining&#39;s essence is to take heaven-earth qi originally shared by all beings into one&#39;s personal dantian. This system is zero-sum from day one</li><li><strong>Cave-heaven blessed-land seizure</strong>: Ji Ning all the way occupies caves, seizes spirit veins, turning &quot;qi-rich zones&quot; into private cultivation grounds</li><li><strong>Qi before all beings</strong>: when draining a domain&#39;s qi to break a realm, narrative never cares whether mortals in the same domain suffer reduced harvests, emaciation</li></ul><h2 id="iv-comparison-with-anchor-symbiosis-s-complete-alternative" tabindex="-1">IV. Comparison With Anchor Symbiosis&#39;s Complete Alternative <a class="header-anchor" href="#iv-comparison-with-anchor-symbiosis-s-complete-alternative" aria-label="Permalink to &quot;IV. Comparison With Anchor Symbiosis&#39;s Complete Alternative&quot;">​</a></h2><table tabindex="0"><thead><tr><th>Manghuang Qi-Refining System</th><th>Anchor-Symbiosis Energy System</th></tr></thead><tbody><tr><td>Draw heaven-earth qi into dantian (zero-sum stock)</td><td>Develop incremental Origin energy; Myriad-Rank Origin two-way circulation</td></tr><tr><td>Blessed lands circled by sects monopolized</td><td>Resource allocation jointly contracted; qi universally accessible</td></tr><tr><td>After absorption mostly heat-dissipated</td><td>Energy circulation and transformation law; energy recovered and reused</td></tr><tr><td>Spirit veins extracted poorer and poorer</td><td>Energy standardization metering; develop increment without consuming stock</td></tr><tr><td>Strong ones alone occupy rich qi</td><td>20% activation strategy; qi allocated by contribution not by fist</td></tr></tbody></table><h2 id="v-quest-sediment-domain-simulation-review-plan" tabindex="-1">V. Quest Sediment Domain Simulation Review Plan <a class="header-anchor" href="#v-quest-sediment-domain-simulation-review-plan" aria-label="Permalink to &quot;V. Quest Sediment Domain Simulation Review Plan&quot;">​</a></h2><ol><li><strong>Modeling</strong>: replicate Manghuang&#39;s &quot;total qi — cultivator count — per-capita drawable&quot; triangle</li><li><strong>Variables</strong>: compare &quot;zero-sum qi-pumping,&quot; &quot;symbiotic circulation,&quot; &quot;Anchor energy infrastructure injected&quot; three models</li><li><strong>Observation</strong>: spirit-vein half-life, per-capita cultivator energy, mortal-domain agricultural yield-loss rate</li><li><strong>Review</strong>: quantified conclusion — under the zero-sum qi-pumping model, spirit-vein half-life sharply shortens as cultivator count rises; the symbiotic-circulation model lets civilization energy grow in step with heaven-earth energy</li></ol><h2 id="vi-setting-self-consistency-retcon-ending-risk-assessment" tabindex="-1">VI. Setting Self-Consistency / Retcon-Ending Risk Assessment <a class="header-anchor" href="#vi-setting-self-consistency-retcon-ending-risk-assessment" aria-label="Permalink to &quot;VI. Setting Self-Consistency / Retcon-Ending Risk Assessment&quot;">​</a></h2><ul><li><strong>Setting self-consistency: medium-low</strong>. Qi &quot;concentration&quot; rises and falls with plot needs; early as thin as a poor mine, late casually grabbing a spirit spring</li><li><strong>Retcon-ending risk: medium</strong>. Total qi volume never given a hard constraint; as soon as the protagonist levels, &quot;the world widens, qi grows richer&quot;</li><li><strong>Protagonist uniqueness dependency: high-leaning-medium</strong>. Qi allocation order maintained by top strong ones; once Ji Ning exits, fighting reignites</li></ul><p>Also settle a fine account: qi-refining system&#39;s zero-sum is not only &quot;you breathe, I have less,&quot; but that it does not even produce qi increment. Spirit veins are innate; cultivators are only porters; no one thinks about how to regenerate spirit veins or circulate qi. Heng Yuan Zhou&#39;s energy-circulation law is the alternative precisely because it turns cultivation from porters into developers — energy is not stock snatched from heaven and earth, but increment jointly nurtured by Myriad Ranks. Whoever first works through this layer jumps out of Manghuang-style zero-sum trap.</p><p><strong>Old-new cosmos resource comparison</strong>: old-cosmos resources and Great Dao are finite, inevitably predatory involution; Anchor Symbiosis has everyone inherently possessing infinite origin, predation loses meaning.</p><h2 id="five-core-takeaways" tabindex="-1">Five Core Takeaways <a class="header-anchor" href="#five-core-takeaways" aria-label="Permalink to &quot;Five Core Takeaways&quot;">​</a></h2><ul><li><strong>Anti-energy waste</strong>: high absorption, low sedimentation, high dissipation; qi largely turns to waste heat</li><li><strong>Anti-predation</strong>: breathing in heaven-earth qi is essentially privatizing shared stock</li><li><strong>Tang-Luo upper-limit comparison</strong>: Tang Luo at least opened human arts; Manghuang cannot even achieve &quot;qi accessible to all&quot;</li><li><strong>Myriad Races full coverage</strong>: demon races, mortals even the &quot;right to breathe&quot; is stripped by blessed-land monopolies</li><li><strong>Hyper-multiverse full openness</strong>: a zero-sum qi pool cannot support an infinite cosmos; must turn to increment development</li></ul><p>The qi-refining system also has an often-overlooked time dimension: it makes cultivators treat &quot;grabbing qi&quot; as a lifelong career. A cultivator from entry to ascension, decades, centuries all fighting others for a breath of qi, simply has no spare to think &quot;where does qi come from.&quot; Heng Yuan Zhou&#39;s energy-circulation law answers this head-on — energy can be nurtured, circulated, standardized. When cultivators discover qi no longer needs grabbing, only then do they first have spare to do other things. Cultivation&#39;s first thread of freedom is not being stronger, but no longer having to grab.</p><h2 id="conclusion" tabindex="-1">Conclusion <a class="header-anchor" href="#conclusion" aria-label="Permalink to &quot;Conclusion&quot;">​</a></h2><p>The qi-refining system&#39;s original sin is not &quot;breathing qi,&quot; but that it defaults qi as stock that can be personally enclosed. Heng Yuan Zhou&#39;s energy view is the opposite: energy should circulate, should increment, should make Myriad Ranks richer the more they use it, not poorer the more they draw. A civilization treating heaven and earth as an ATM will sooner or later discover — the day the ATM has no money either.</p><p>In the final analysis, Manghuang Ji · qi-refining-system critique · zero-sum game of devouring heaven-earth qi described in this document is no isolated case — its causality and energy-level traces are filed throughout in the Alaya Network, traceable and verifiable.</p><h2 id="related" tabindex="-1">Related <a class="header-anchor" href="#related" aria-label="Permalink to &quot;Related&quot;">​</a></h2><ul><li>Related documents: <a href="./399_模块2-莽荒纪-纪宁掠夺思维拆解-修仙路上的资源消耗.html">Entry 399 · Ji-Ning Predatory-Thinking Decomposition</a> · <a href="./401_模块2-莽荒纪-炼体体系批判-身体即战场的掠夺内化.html">Entry 401 · Body-Refining-System Critique</a> · <a href="./../wanling-hengmao-origin-universe-archive/docs/zh/15-能量循环与转化法则.html">15-Energy Circulation and Transformation Law</a></li></ul>',28)])])}const m=i(o,[["render",s]]);export{d as __pageData,m as default};
